 "description": "Search BRREG kunngj\u00f8ringer across all Norwegian companies \u2014 filter by type (konkurs, fusjon, ...), date range, NACE-code, or location. Use for trend analysis ('all konkurser in restaurant sector last quarter') or radar-style monitoring.",
